<title>UK: Den Norske Bank sets $110 mln 10-yr step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Den Norske Bank sets $110 mln 10-yr step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Chase Manhattan International and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEN NORSKE BANK ASA</p>
<p> AMT    $110 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    ** MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN  ** 30 BP     PAY DATE    30.MA7.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.929    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.929</p>
<p>NOTES  **  CALL AT PAR FROM MAY 2002, AFTER WHICH MARGIN STEPS UP</p>
<p>		TO 105 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
